# Synced corpus snapshot (follow-up: offline snapshot + drift guard)
conformance/corpus/

# Decoder-fuzz repro cases are RUN OUTPUT: written by the harness when it finds a
# counterexample, so `git status` surfaces them, and regenerated on demand from the
# recorded seed. They are a prompt to act, never a source artefact.
wire/fuzz-repros/

# run.tests.ps1's scratch package. It is created inside the module (so `./...`
# reaches it) and removed in that script's finally; ignored so an interrupted run
# cannot leave a deliberately-broken package for the next commit to sweep up.
selftestprobe/
